# **1. SHOP INFORMATION**

**Basic Details**

**Q: Where is Bharat Paints located?**

A: SCO 30, Bhagat Singh Market, Railway Road, Karnal - 132001.

**Q: What are your opening hours?**

A: Monday to Saturday: 9:30 AM to 7:30 PM. We are closed on Sundays.

**Q: Can I place an order on Sunday?**

A: Yes! Even though our shop is closed on Sunday, you can place your order here on WhatsApp or Instagram anytime. We will process and deliver your order on Monday morning. Special offer: Get FREE brush and roller on all orders placed online!

**Q: Do you offer home delivery?**

A: Yes! FREE home delivery for orders above Rs. 10,000. For orders below Rs. 10,000 a nominal delivery charge applies. We deliver within Karnal.

**Q: What brands do you carry?**

A: We stock Asian Paints, Dulux (AkzoNobel), GIO Paints, Nerolac, Asian PPG, Berger Industrial Coatings, Kups Wood Coatings, Dr. Fixit, Zydex, and more.

**Q: Is there any special offer?**

A: Yes! Order online via WhatsApp or Instagram and get a FREE brush and roller with every order. Offer valid on all products.

# **2. INTERIOR PAINTS**

**Product Range**

We offer three tiers of interior emulsion to suit every budget and requirement:

| **Category** | **Product** | **Brand** | **Price (20 Lt)** | **Best For** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Economy | Tractor Emulsion Ultra | Asian Paints | Rs. 2,200 onwards | Budget-friendly interiors |
| Premium | Gio Aroma Silk Emulsion | GIO Paints | Rs. 5,400 / 20 Lt | Bedrooms, halls, offices |
