**Common Questions — Waterproofing**

**Q: Dampness is still coming after I got waterproofing done elsewhere.**

A: This happens when the wrong product is used or surface preparation was inadequate. We offer a FREE site inspection. Our team will diagnose the root cause and recommend the correct solution with a company-backed guarantee of 1, 5, or 10 years.

**Q: What guarantee do you give on waterproofing?**

A: We provide company-backed guarantees: 1 year (basic treatment), 5 years (standard), and 10 years (premium system). The guarantee is from the product manufacturer like Dr. Fixit or Asian Paints.

**Q: My terrace leaks during monsoon — what should I do?**

A: Book a FREE site visit before monsoon. We will inspect, clean, and apply the right waterproofing system. Terrace waterproofing typically takes 2-3 days and comes with 5-10 year guarantee.

