**Our Workshop**

We have our own workshop where Duco and PU paint jobs are done professionally. Customers can bring furniture or wooden items to our workshop for spray finishing.

**Duco Colour Finishes**

**Q: Can I get any colour in Duco finish?**

A: Yes! We have the complete RAL shade card and NCS shade card. Any colour you choose can be mixed and applied. Perfect for custom furniture, modular kitchens, and designer interiors.

**Q: What is the price for Duco work at your workshop?**

A: Duco finishing price depends on the item size and number of coats. Share photos of your furniture and we will give you a quote. WhatsApp us at our number directly.

**Common Questions — Wood Coatings**

**Q: I want to paint my wooden furniture — what do I need?**

A: For best results: (1) Sand the surface, (2) Apply Epoxy Clear Sealer as base, (3) Apply PU Clear Sealer, (4) Apply 2 coats PU Topcoat in Matt, Satin, or Gloss as per your preference. We can do this at our workshop or send our team to your location in Karnal.

**Q: I want a Duco finish on my kitchen cabinets.**

A: Duco is our specialty! We use PU White Sealer as base followed by Duco colour topcoat from RAL or NCS shade cards. The finish is smooth, durable and washable. Bring your cabinet doors to our workshop or we can visit your site.

