**Common Questions — Industrial**

**Q: I need paint for my rice mill machinery.**

A: For rice mill machinery we recommend: (1) Epoxy 1K Grey Primer as base coat — excellent adhesion and rust protection, (2) Epoxy or PU topcoat for final finish. This combination protects against moisture, rice dust, and corrosion. Available in grey, red oxide, and other colours. We provide applicator service for industrial jobs in Karnal. Contact us for a FREE site visit and quote.

**Q: I need paint for my factory floor.**

A: For factory floors we recommend Epoxy Floor Coating from Asian PPG or Berger. It is chemical resistant, easy to clean, and very durable. Available in grey, green, and red colours. Price and quantity depends on floor area. Share your floor dimensions for an exact quote.

**Q: I need to paint my warehouse — what is the best option?**

A: For warehouses: exterior walls need weatherproof coating, interior walls need anti-fungal emulsion, and floors need epoxy coating. We offer complete solutions with applicator service. Book a FREE site visit for proper assessment.

**Q: Do you provide bulk pricing for industrial orders?**

A: Yes! For bulk orders we offer special pricing. Contact us directly on WhatsApp with your requirements and quantity needed and we will give you the best rate.

