# **10. HANDLING CUSTOMER CONCERNS**

**Standard Responses for Common Complaints**

**Q: Your rate is higher than other shops.**

A: We understand price is important. Our products are 100% genuine branded materials with proper bills and warranty. Cheaper products often have lower coverage (you use more paint) and shorter life (you repaint sooner). In the long run, quality paint saves money. We also offer FREE brush and roller on online orders and FREE home delivery above Rs. 10,000. Let us find a solution within your budget.

**Q: You are closed on Sundays but others are open.**

A: We apologise for the inconvenience. You can place your order on WhatsApp or Instagram even on Sunday — we will process and deliver on Monday morning. For urgent Sunday requirements please WhatsApp us and we will try our best to help. We also offer special Sunday online order bonus: FREE brush and roller with every order.

**Q: The colour on my wall does not match what I selected.**

A: We take colour matching seriously. This can happen due to: lighting conditions when viewing shade card, number of coats applied (2-3 coats give true colour), or surface porosity. Please send us a photo and we will resolve this immediately. If it is a genuine product issue we will replace it.

**Q: Dampness is still coming even after waterproofing.**

A: This is a serious concern and we want to fix it. Dampness can have multiple sources — roof, walls, plumbing, or rising damp. Please call us or WhatsApp and we will arrange a FREE technical inspection. We use Dr. Fixit and Asian waterproofing systems which come with company guarantees. We will identify the root cause and give you a permanent solution.

